1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Welcome to MovieBox subtitle styling.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
This demo uses 1080p video with a bundled SRT file.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Cinematic style: rounded pill with 50% black background.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Each line fades in when the cue changes.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,500
Change the look in Settings → Playback → Subtitle Style.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Try “Cinematic”, “Large white”, or “Yellow on black”.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
This is not a Dolby Vision or HDR10 test stream.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
For HDR, use a real HDR file or torrent release.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Subtitles should stay readable on bright and dark scenes.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
If you can read this clearly, styling is working.
